{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a mysterious library where endless bookshelves form a sprawling labyrinth. The air is silent, the light is dim, and scattered books suggest that something has disturbed this place long ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to escape by solving puzzles, exploring the environment, and uncovering clues hidden among the shelves and pages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies, no combat \u2014 only your mind and the path to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section of the library holds its own secret: ancient mechanisms, cryptic symbols, and echoes of the past may guide you \u2014 or lead you astray. Can you uncover the truth of the labyrinth and find your way out?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3428520?t=1766027969","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428520/47a3c28522307b57eb1af03d1bf73003eedcb4fe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766027969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428520/e8d86704f929c11094f5fab4a78d5f9d6b133297/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766027969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428520/e8d86704f929c11094f5fab4a78d5f9d6b133297/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766027969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a mysterious library where endless bookshelves form a sprawling labyrinth. The air is silent, the light is dim, and scattered books suggest that something has disturbed this place long ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to escape by solving puzzles, exploring the environment, and uncovering clues hidden among the shelves and pages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no enemies, no combat \u2014 only